    "description": "The Ultimate Enclosed Roadside Farmstand Blueprint\n\nTake your homesteading business to the next level with a roadside storefront built for security, capacity, and rustic charm. Unlike open-air tables, this comprehensive digital woodworking plan guides you through building a massive, fully enclosed farm stand featuring classic double barn doors.\n\nWhether you need a safe place to leave your goods overnight or want a structure that protects your delicate products from the wind and rain, this heavy-duty market stall is the ultimate solution for serious roadside vendors.\n\nEngineered for Security & Sales:\nThis isn't just a stand; it's a permanent-style retail kiosk designed to protect your hard work.\n\nLockable Double Barn Doors: The wide-opening front doors allow customers to see your entire display during the day, and can be securely padlocked at night. No more hauling your inventory back and forth every evening!\n\nWeather-Resistant Architecture: The enclosed walls and steep pitched roof provide deep shade and protection from sudden rain, keeping your bakery items and fresh produce safe.\n\nMassive Retail Footprint: With nearly 100 inches of width, this structure is essentially a walk-in kiosk, giving you unparalleled space for multi-tiered shelving and high-volume inventory.\n\nTargeted for High-Profit Niches:\nBased on the most requested designs from our maker community, this blueprint is perfectly optimized if you are looking for:\n\nFarmstand Plans for Sourdough & Artisan Breads\n\nPlans for Roadside Flower Stand & Nursery Plants\n\nSecure Egg Stand for Selling Eggs & Dairy\n\nVegetable Stand Plans for Farm-to-Table Produce\n\nFoodstand DIY & Local Honey Booths\n\nCraft Supplies & Artisan Market Stall\n\nFully Assembled Dimensions:\n\nOverall Width: 97-1/2 inches\n\nOverall Depth: 49-1/2 inches\n\nOverall Height: 135-1/4 inches (from the ground to the roof peak)\n\nInside Your Digital PDF Download:\nYour instant download provides a professional-grade building guide, ensuring a frustration-free woodworking experience:\n\nGlobal Measurement Standards: Fully detailed in both Imperial (inches) and Metric (mm).\n\nPrecise Material & Cut Lists: Buy exactly what you need at the lumber yard and follow the cut guide to minimize your waste.\n\nStep-by-Step 3D Assembly: Crystal-clear visual diagrams that walk you through framing the floor, erecting the enclosed walls, building the roof truss, and hanging the heavy-duty barn doors.\n\n(Friendly Reminder: This listing is for a digital PDF woodworking plan. No physical farmstand, materials, or tools will be shipped.)\n\nBuild a secure storefront that works as hard as you do. Download your plans today and upgrade your roadside business!",
